Task 1
-------
Create a pod using the imperative command and use nginx as the image

Cmd: kubectl run pod_name --image=nginx:lates
Task2
------
Create the YAML from the nginx pod created in task 1
cmd: kubectl run task_1_pod_name --image:nginx:latest -o yaml

Update the pod name in the YAML
cmd: kubectl run nginx-pod --image=nginx:latest --dry-run=client -o yaml > new_pod.yaml

Use that YAML to create a new pod with the name nginx-new.
cmd: kubectl create -f  new_pod.yaml

